{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wreck objects:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash streetlights, billboards, barrels, and barricades. Every hit drives your points higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explode traffic:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as sparks fly, fire spreads, and smoke raise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Takedown helicopters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send helicopters crashing to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boost everywhere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you go, the harder you hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain combos:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link crashes, explosions, and takedowns into one relentless streak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New rides:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle changes how you drive. Heavier, faster, or a fuel barrel on wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different challenges:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you can wreck it all in timed runs, traffic bowling, precision stunts, and high-risk targets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980070?t=1759953206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/784da39ca8c86ce04a36c4de861205012700b764/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759953206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/b59b868e3c245ba772c40189e11eacd7cffadaf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759953206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/b59b868e3c245ba772c40189e11eacd7cffadaf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759953206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller s